  "bodyHash": "o6sXHoMfQ00=",
  "content": "你好<p><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>警告！</strong></span><strong>这是<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/223628\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223628\" width=\"40\" height=\"26\" />神秘时代</a>的扩展模组，同时需要安装<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hammer-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=247401\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />HammerLib</a>作为前置。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>免责声明：本模组部分内容较为强力，若不喜请立即退出，或使用CraftTweaker自行调整平衡性！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组为神秘时代添加了<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/colored-lux\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=347912\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />Colored Lux</a>的彩色光源支持！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这是我在保留部分旧版创意的基础上完全重制的神秘时代扩展模组。</p>\n<p>当前内容包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>方块：\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/aspect_combiner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />要素合成器 - 将两种液态要素融合为复合要素</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/crystal_crusher.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />晶体粉碎机 - 用于获取灵盐</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/aura_disperser.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />灵气扩散器 - 对周围生物施加盐效果</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/aura_charger.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />灵气充能器 - 消耗天域要素补充本地灵气</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/crystal_bore.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />晶体钻探机 - 开采前方晶体矿脉，仅保留一个晶簇</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/entity_summoner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />实体召唤器 - 使用实体单元为模板消耗灵炁召唤生物</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/puriflower.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />净化花 - 缓慢清除本地灵气中的混沌值</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/jar_brass.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />黄铜注魔罐 - 275灵炁容量的注魔罐</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/jar_thaumium.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />神秘强化罐 - 350灵炁容量的注魔罐</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/jar_void.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />虚空强化罐 - 500灵炁容量的注魔罐</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/jar_mithrillium.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />秘银强化罐 - 1000灵炁容量的注魔罐</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/jar_adaminite.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />精金强化罐 - 2000灵炁容量的注魔罐</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/jar_mithminite.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />秘金罐 - 4000灵炁容量且能自动清除多余要素</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithrillium_smelter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />秘银熔炉 - 100%要素转化为浆液，0%转化为混沌</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/adaminite_smelter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />精金熔炉 - 120%要素转化为浆液，0%转化为混沌</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithminite_smelter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />秘金熔炉 - 150%要素转化为浆液，0%转化为混沌</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/crystal_block.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />晶体块 - 不仅是9个晶体的压缩存储形式...</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/dawn_totem.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />黎明图腾 - 缓慢吸收混沌值，有极小概率泄漏（1/64几率）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/dusk_totem.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />暮色图腾 - 缓慢污染灵气，较大概率泄漏（1/8几率）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/growth_chamber.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />晶体培育舱 - 以晶体块为模板培育各类晶体</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/seal.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />符文阵 - 通过特定符文组合执行各种功能</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/arcane_cake.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />奥术蛋糕 - 可食用，缓慢恢复生命，可施加灵盐效果</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/flux_concentrator.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />混沌聚集器 - 创造混沌污染区域使蘑菇转化为灵视菇</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/thaumic_lectern.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />奥秘法典讲台 - 方块形态的奥秘法典</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/shadow_enchanter.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><a href=\"https://youtu.be/ayJeqMEI8Bw\">暗影附魔台</a> - 精确选择物品附魔属性</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/essentia_sink.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />要素虹吸器 - 为暗影光束法杖充能异域要素</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/void_anvil.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />虚空铁砧 - 无限耐久的铁砧，损坏时会污染灵气</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/amber_lamp.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />琥珀灯 - 装饰性光源（兼容ColoredLux）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/iron_framed_greatwood.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />铁框伟木 - 带连接纹理的装饰方块</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/brass_plated_silverwood.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />镀银铜木 - 带连接纹理的装饰方块</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/chiseled_amber_block.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />雕纹琥珀块 - 装饰方块</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/taintwood_planks.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />腐化木板 - 安全使用的装饰方块</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/taintkin.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />腐化之种 - 安全使用的装饰方块</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/taintkin_lit.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />腐化灯笼 - 装饰性光源（兼容ColoredLux）安全使用</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>物品：\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithrillium_nugget.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithrillium_ingot.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithrillium_plate.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithrillium_block.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithrillium_resonator.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />秘银（粒/锭/板/块/共振器）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/adaminite_nugget.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/adaminite_ingot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/adaminite_plate.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/adaminite_block.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/adaminite_fabric.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />精金（粒/锭/板/块/织料）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithminite_nugget.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithminite_ingot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithminite_plate.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithminite_block.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithminite_fabric.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />秘金（粒/锭/板/块/织料）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/levitation_device.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />悬浮装置</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/odour_powder.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />气味粉末</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithminite_blade.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />秘金刃</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/mithminite_handle.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />秘金柄</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/salt_essence.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />灵盐 - 可施加于食物产生不同效果，可用水桶清洗</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/zeith_fur.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />蓝狼毛皮 - 增加观察值与理论值的饰品</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/entity_cell.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />实体单元 - 类似EU2的金套索/MFR的捕捉网</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/recharge_charm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />充能护符 - 类似灵炁护符的饰品</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/seal_symbol.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />符文符号 - 置于符文阵上执行特定功能（每个要素对应一种符号）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/seal_globe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />符文球 - 查看当前符文阵功能</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/fragnant_pendant.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />芬芳坠饰 - 提供防止扭曲效果的精神增益</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/knowledge_tome.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />知识典籍 - 存储研究进度，可转移给其他玩家</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/chester.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />切斯特 - 4行容量的跟随储物箱，仅能被骨眼摧毁</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/bone_eye.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />骨眼 - 控制切斯特，右键切换跟随模式，潜行右键分解</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/vis_pod.gif\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />灵视荚 - 熔炉燃料</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/vis_seeds.gif\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />灵视种子 - 可种植灵视荚的作物</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/void_elemental_hoe.gif\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />虚空生长锄 - 类似原版生长锄，但能自动修复</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/void_thaumometer.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />虚空探秘杖 - 显示混沌裂隙稳定值</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/vis_scribing_tools.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />灵炁刻印工具 - 消耗灵气替代墨水的刻印工具</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/wormhole_mirror.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />虫洞镜 - 在绑定镜子间传送</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/adaminite_hood.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/adaminite_robe.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions/adaminite_belt.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/thaumadditions",
